{"synopsis":"\\[DariStudio yang mengerjakan \\<The Regressed Mercenary's Machinations dan A Regressor’s Tale of Cultivation>]\n\nRoberta, seorang pendeta wanita gereja, ditunjuk sebagai kepala pendeta wanita di wilayah terpencil di ujung utara—Dithmar.\n\nKarena penunjukan itu terjadi segera setelah hilangnya pendahulunya, Roberta tetap waspada dan mulai menyelidiki Duke Ulrich dari Dithmarschen.\n\nMenurut rumor, ia telah memerintah wilayah tersebut selama lebih dari 300 tahun, dan bahkan mengaku sebagai makhluk abadi... seseorang yang menjalani kehidupan yang seharusnya tidak mampu dimiliki manusia.\n\nBertekad untuk mengungkap kebenaran, Roberta memutuskan untuk menelusuri jejaknya.","alternative_title":"불로불사로 산다는 것은","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"16585a97-4aee-482f-9cf7-8620c216ca8c","number":"23","chapter":"23","title":"","date":"2026-07-30","released":"2026-07-30"},{"chapter_id":"02853d25-b824-49e1-9620-87f1a5b57c0e","number":"22","chapter":"22","title":"","date":"2026-07-23","released":"2026-07-23"},{"chapter_id":"fdd31334-3253-42c7-b89c-c9b0264a31ed","number":"21","chapter":"21","title":"","date":"2026-07-15","released":"2026-07-15"},{"chapter_id":"49c894b2-e2b6-4241-bc4c-5dfeb942ece8","number":"20","chapter":"20","title":"","date":"2026-07-08","released":"2026-07-08"},{"chapter_id":"fcaebf0f-9004-4710-b293-de7796586131","number":"19","chapter":"19","title":"","date":"2026-07-01","released":"2026-07-01"},{"chapter_id":"6ca7aa54-fed4-4722-8a65-7f7b3e7aabaa","number":"18","chapter":"18","title":"","date":"2026-06-26","released":"2026-06-26"},{"chapter_id":"75167c23-92bd-4aa3-a782-0e6b11611ed3","number":"17","chapter":"17","title":"","date":"2026-06-16","released":"2026-06-16"},{"chapter_id":"8df54e06-5c01-480d-9bb0-bad7b3d042f5","number":"16","chapter":"16","title":"","date":"2026-06-10","released":"2026-06-10"},{"chapter_id":"07681cbe-b79c-48a8-9de0-7798ddb44423","number":"15","chapter":"15","title":"","date":"2026-06-05",